5:["$","h2",null,{"children":"How does your GPA work?"}]
6:["$","p","Your Grade Point Average is a score used to evaluate your accomplishment throughout your degree program. In the same manner that your professors and instructors give you a grade to evaluate your progress or success in their course.",{"children":"Your Grade Point Average is a score used to evaluate your accomplishment throughout your degree program. In the same manner that your professors and instructors give you a grade to evaluate your progress or success in their course."}]
7:["$","p","Average GPA",{"children":"Average GPA"}]
8:["$","p","is a statistic that represents how well you did in your classes throughout the semester, term, and year. Your GPA will fluctuate throughout your time at university and will be affected by how well you improve your total grades (or, in some cases, how much you fell behind).",{"children":"is a statistic that represents how well you did in your classes throughout the semester, term, and year. Your GPA will fluctuate throughout your time at university and will be affected by how well you improve your total grades (or, in some cases, how much you fell behind)."}]
9:["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]
a:["$","section","Comparison of GPA to Indian Grading System",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Comparison of GPA to Indian Grading System"}],[["$","p","In India, we simply divide the scores into distinctions and divisions, with distinctions indicating great performance, the first division indicating satisfactory performance, and so on. The standards for your grades in America are also defined. A GPA of 2.0 or higher is usually required to pass a course. Less than that is deemed a failing grade, and you will have to retake the course. This is not standard, and it varies amongst universities, institutions, and schools.",{"children":"In India, we simply divide the scores into distinctions and divisions, with distinctions indicating great performance, the first division indicating satisfactory performance, and so on. The standards for your grades in America are also defined. A GPA of 2.0 or higher is usually required to pass a course. Less than that is deemed a failing grade, and you will have to retake the course. This is not standard, and it varies amongst universities, institutions, and schools."}],["$","p","A minimum GPA of 2.75 may be required by some colleges or professional courses. In general, anything above 3.75 is considered good, 2.75–3.75 is considered normal, and less than 2.5 is considered poor.",{"children":"A minimum GPA of 2.75 may be required by some colleges or professional courses. In general, anything above 3.75 is considered good, 2.75–3.75 is considered normal, and less than 2.5 is considered poor."}],["$","p","Check out",{"children":"Check out"}],["$","p","How much GPA is Required for Admission in UMBC",{"children":"How much GPA is Required for Admission in UMBC"}],["$","p","?",{"children":"?"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
b:["$","section","Why is GPA so Significant?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why is GPA so Significant?"}],[["$","p","When a university admissions committee examines your GPA, the first question that springs to mind is. –",{"children":"When a university admissions committee examines your GPA, the first question that springs to mind is. –"}],["$","p","“",{"children":"“"}],["$","p","What kind of a student are you",{"children":"What kind of a student are you"}],["$","p","?",{"children":"?"}],["$","p","” A higher GPA says a lot about you, whereas a lower GPA paints a negative picture in their minds.",{"children":"” A higher GPA says a lot about you, whereas a lower GPA paints a negative picture in their minds."}],["$","p","However, this does not imply that all students with lower GPAs are not efficient or good enough to study overseas. Or that they would never have the opportunity to do so. Several students",{"children":"However, this does not imply that all students with lower GPAs are not efficient or good enough to study overseas. Or that they would never have the opportunity to do so. Several students"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
c:["$","section","approach our counsellors",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"approach our counsellors"}],[["$","p","with a desire to pursue higher education overseas. Who, for whatever reason, we’re unable to achieve higher grades in high school. Because of their hard work and perseverance, students can gain admission not just to prestigious institutions abroad, but also to good universities in the United States.",{"children":"with a desire to pursue higher education overseas. Who, for whatever reason, we’re unable to achieve higher grades in high school. Because of their hard work and perseverance, students can gain admission not just to prestigious institutions abroad, but also to good universities in the United States."}],["$","p","The grade point average (GPA) is a statistic used by most organizations and institutions to assess your performance. When you apply for a study visa in a specific nation, the visa officer may query your low GPA. And be skeptical of your sincere intentions to study abroad. In such instances, you don’t need to force him or her to believe you; instead, you can handle the matter more patiently and effectively.",{"children":"The grade point average (GPA) is a statistic used by most organizations and institutions to assess your performance. When you apply for a study visa in a specific nation, the visa officer may query your low GPA. And be skeptical of your sincere intentions to study abroad. In such instances, you don’t need to force him or her to believe you; instead, you can handle the matter more patiently and effectively."}],["$","p","When applying for education, such as a postgraduate degree in another country, your undergraduate grades are not your only option. GPA in 10th or 12th grade is taken into account, so make sure the grades are good.",{"children":"When applying for education, such as a postgraduate degree in another country, your undergraduate grades are not your only option. GPA in 10th or 12th grade is taken into account, so make sure the grades are good."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
d:["$","section","GPA is not The Ultimate Game Changer",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"GPA is not The Ultimate Game Changer"}],[["$","p","It’s not always possible for GPA to rule the roost! A low GPA does not imply that the student lacks creativity or intelligence. There are a variety of explanations for a person’s low GPA; it could be family problems or emotional distress, resulting in a poor GPA in his final-year exams.",{"children":"It’s not always possible for GPA to rule the roost! A low GPA does not imply that the student lacks creativity or intelligence. There are a variety of explanations for a person’s low GPA; it could be family problems or emotional distress, resulting in a poor GPA in his final-year exams."}],["$","p","Certain factors, such as your résumé, SOP, LOR, and test scores, will count more than your GPA, once you  move on to further study and careers. As a result, there are other ways to demonstrate your ability, and a high GPA isn’t the only option.",{"children":"Certain factors, such as your résumé, SOP, LOR, and test scores, will count more than your GPA, once you  move on to further study and careers. As a result, there are other ways to demonstrate your ability, and a high GPA isn’t the only option."}],["$","p","What is your grade point average (GPA) and",{"children":"What is your grade point average (GPA) and"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
e:["$","section","where do you wish to study abroad?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"where do you wish to study abroad?"}],[["$","p","Please tell us about your qualifications. One Window shall surely help you with your international admissions.",{"children":"Please tell us about your qualifications. One Window shall surely help you with your international admissions."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
